        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Issue 21826: Restore browser-extension-template recommendation]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43777</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43777"/>
        <updated>2026-04-14T00:06:25.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">The recommendation for using <a href="https://github.com/fregante/browser-extension-template">browser-extension-template</a> to set up an extension project was removed from the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/Build_a_cross_browser_extension" rel="nofollow">Build a cross-browser extension</a> page in October 2022. At that time, the template was updated to Manifest V3, but the how-to page has not been updated.</p>
<p dir="auto">The how-to page has been updated to cover Manifest V3, so the recommendation can be restored.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto">Fixes #121826</p>]]></content>
